==== Design Overview

Prospective longitudinal observational study with serial TSPO-PET imaging, detailed PEM documentation, and an activity-matched healthy comparator group. The study enrolls 75 ME/CFS patients to yield approximately 50 high-affinity TSPO binders (rs6971) for the primary analysis. Mixed- and low-affinity binders are retained in a pre-specified secondary stratum, because their binding is genotype-dependent and cannot be pooled with the primary group.

